type: software
title: "WasteWise-ml"
abstract: "Open image-classification model that identifies waste items by material class and grade from a phone or low-cost camera. It is the software brain of the WasteWise family: WasteWise Scan adds near-infrared sensing for plastic resin type, and ReflowEconomy uses the sorted output."
